        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lacu, Kari Lahtinen\n- Organizations: Hanoi Rocks\n- Places: Finland, Tampere, Northern Europe\n- Concepts: population\n\nFacts:\n- Finland is officially the Republic of Finland and is a sovereign state in Northern Europe.\n- Finland had a population of 5.5 million in 2016, and most of Finland's population was concentrated in the southern region.\n- Lacu, born as Kari Lahtinen in 1969 in Tampere, is a Finnish drummer.\n- Lacu was best known for playing in the Finnish rock band Hanoi Rocks from its reformation in 2002 until his departure in 2008.",
